# Free token from https://ion.cesium.com (Access Tokens > Default Token).
# With it the simulator draws real elevation (Cesium World Terrain), sharp Bing aerial imagery and
# every mapped building in 3D (Cesium OSM Buildings). Without it, it falls back to Esri satellite
# imagery and a simplified landmark model.
# Tip: restrict the token to your site's URL in the ion dashboard.
VITE_CESIUM_ION_TOKEN=

# Optional: use Google Photorealistic 3D Tiles instead (add the asset in ion's Asset Depot first).
# Google's 3D coverage of Indian cities is low-resolution, so the default 'cesium' usually looks better.
# VITE_WORLD_SOURCE=google
